USE knowledge/tool-knowledge.flow

DO Resolve the requested ticket ID, absolute project, and private absolute acli
    executable using @tool_guidance.
    Return an object with ticket_id, project, and acli. AS task_context

RUN @task_context.acli jira workitem view @task_context.ticket_id --fields "key,issuetype,summary,status,assignee,description,attachment" --json
AS jira_result

DO Parse @jira_result.stdout as JSON. Verify its key equals
    @task_context.ticket_id and the requested details are complete. Retain the
    complete ticket with its project as the active task in conversation context.
    Preserve descriptions, criteria, lists, tables, attachments, media names and
    URLs, and unresolved references. Invent no criteria or mappings. Write no
    files and preserve existing drafts. Return the ticket object. AS ticket

PRINT Report @task_context.ticket_id and its summary briefly; the task is loaded in conversation context.
